---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Ezaz Ahmed — software engineer, interface craftsperson, and engineering blogger."
>
  <div class="canvas about-page">
    <header class="about-header">
      <div class="avatar-wrapper">
        <div class="avatar accent-gradient" aria-hidden="true">EA</div>
        <div class="avatar-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-intro">
        <h1 class="about-name">Ezaz Ahmed</h1>
        <p class="about-role">Software Engineer &amp; Writer</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-body prose">
      <p>
        I'm a software engineer who cares deeply about the craft of building for the web.
        This site is where I think out loud — through writing, code, and the occasional data visualization.
      </p>

      <p>
        My work spans frontend engineering, developer tooling, and the intersection of performance
        and interface design. I'm particularly interested in:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Making fast things — rendering, bundling, runtime performance</li>
        <li>Making beautiful things — typography, interaction design, motion</li>
        <li>Making maintainable things — architecture, DX, documentation</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        When I'm not writing code or writing words, you'll probably find me reading about
        programming language theory or obsessing over font kerning.
      </p>

      <h2>Tech I reach for</h2>

      <p>
        Day-to-day: TypeScript, Astro, React, Rust. Occasionally: Go, Python, SQL.
        Always: whatever the problem actually needs.
      </p>

      <h2>This site</h2>

      <p>
        Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro 6</a> and
        <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tailwind CSS v4</a>.
        Zero JavaScript unless opted in. Dark mode without a flash. Spring physics via pure CSS.
        No frameworks, no runtimes — just the platform.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page { padding-bottom: 5rem; }

  .about-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .avatar-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .avatar {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .avatar-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -4px;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent-from), var(--color-accent-to));
    opacity: 0.2;
    filter: blur(8px);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .about-name {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  :global(html.dark) .about-name { color: var(--color-dark-text-primary); }

  .about-role {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  :global(html.dark) .about-role { color: var(--color-dark-text-secondary); }

  .about-body {
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
</style>
